msgid "**User — their team, published shifts**"
msgstr "**Utilisateur — son équipe, postes publiés**"

#: ../../content/planning/index.md:28
msgid ""
"The confirmed shifts of their team, their own shifts and the shifts without "
"a team"
msgstr ""
"Les postes confirmés de son équipe, ses propres postes et les postes sans "
"équipe"

#: ../../content/planning/index.md:28
msgid "Takes an open shift of their role"
msgstr "Prend un poste ouvert de son rôle"

#: ../../content/planning/index.md:28
msgid "**Manager — every shift, no settings**"
msgstr "**Responsable — tous les postes, sans les réglages**"

#: ../../content/planning/index.md:28
